<item><title>当声景开始重塑视觉：一场声音设计实验</title><link>http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIwMzU5NDI2NQ==&amp;mid=2247669198&amp;idx=2&amp;sn=42ef657f33092b7a1500da7eeedf1863&amp;chksm=9787efaec9c80836f72fd594cb662c2e8c4ef53da9766c89f89a32b2518fd2631351d3da7c5d&amp;scene=0#rd</link><guid>http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIwMzU5NDI2NQ==&amp;mid=2247669198&amp;idx=2&amp;sn=42ef657f33092b7a1500da7eeedf1863&amp;chksm=9787efaec9c80836f72fd594cb662c2e8c4ef53da9766c89f89a32b2518fd2631351d3da7c5d&amp;scene=0#rd</guid><author>凹凸镜DOC - 今天看啥</author><pubDate>2026-04-25T13:12:00.399Z</pubDate><description>本文转自：纪录公社 Jilu Commune 声音设计的历史本身短暂而错杂…</description><category>创投训练营</category><category>活动</category><content:encoded><![CDATA[<div id="user-content-media">

                
                    <img src="http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/vRj1wt8WnHxjK2DfOBLgT7mkenk8oH6edAeI5aYXTo6OicsXYNIW75prVvcn3bZbZFpKwFopktlwtGS9W0p6CPjiaTvJdmwN9DEq6rYaRWEwg/0?wx_fmt=jpeg?imageView2/1/w/600">
                
