        <div id="user-content-js_content"><section style="font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);margin-bottom: 24px;"><section style="text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 90px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="text-align: center;"><img src="http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/VwtRVX0wRzMujOcNlxJMfgjhWRpIkqx1sBC4Wich0u7QqkkDmtia7ZX0wqyvnqZw3pwv2alFtW8GTvQVxnjZrDJQ/640?wx_fmt=gif" style="max-width: 600px"></section><section style="max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 96%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 600px" src="http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/vRj1wt8WnHySuutS9kwiayY7PiaCMNeVcudugQUJgzA6EnT3G59qO1aONDOys9LXk4qKyqqg15P5giaayYiclgdFDpBpMz3wiaBUXUMPdkYAP1r0/640?wx_fmt=png&#x26;from=appmsg"></section></section><section style="text-align: center;justify-content: center;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px 0px 60px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="display: inline-block;width: 96%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;margin: 0px;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="margin: 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="text-align: right;"><span><span style="color: #888888;">本文转自：</span></span><span><span style="color: #888888;">纪录公社 Jilu Commune</span></span></section><section style="max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;text-align: right;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 600px" src="http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/vRj1wt8WnHzicDAXzOS0j6CV56JYyImU773OiathTZjjxN31BmAiarElFtiaWEwqoibjJmQUpHuPy52FE4CzEQT7Dl9ibWUWnLljIlmVRFbKMOuOQ/640?wx_fmt=png&#x26;from=appmsg"></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: center;justify-content: center;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px 0px 90px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="display: inline-block;width: 96%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="justify-content: center;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="display: inline-block;width: 90%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="text-align: justify;color: rgb(32, 32, 32);font-family: PingFangSC-light;letter-spacing: 0.7px;line-height: 1.86;box-sizing: border-box;"><p style="white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.7px;box-sizing: border-box;"><span>声音设计的历史本身短暂而错杂，或者说，它仍然正在发生之中。</span></span></strong><span style="letter-spacing: 0.7px;box-sizing: border-box;"><span>有人将其视为已经完成建构的学科，也有人将其理解为一种仍在持续生成的实践形态，流动于音乐、技术与影像之中。</span></span></p><p style="white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><span><br></span></p><p style="white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><span>电话、留声机、麦克风、磁带……这些发明贯穿起声音被技术性地“捕获”的历史，让其成为可以被储存与再现的对象。但真正让一切不同的“决定性”瞬间是——复制、扭曲、拼接、失真——乃至误用，脱离发生情境的声音也脱离了常规。</span></p><p style="white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><span><br></span></p><p style="white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><span>在这些偏离常规的尝试中，声音设计逐渐显现出它的可能性：它不依赖乐理，也不依赖技术门槛——它可以从任何一个日常的动作、物件，甚至一次错误开始。</span></p><p style="white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><span><br></span></p><p style="white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><span>当噪音与未来主义相遇，当人声第一次从银幕中“开口说话”，当拟音开始“伪造现实”，当声景开始重塑视觉，</span><strong style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span>声音不再只是附属，而成为一种主动建构世界的方式</span></strong><span>。在这一层面上，声音与纪录影像中长期被讨论的“真实”问题发生了交汇。拟音对现实的替代、环境声对空间的重组、声音节奏对情绪的引导，都在不同程度上参与着这一建构过程，同时也持续重塑着观看本身。</span></p><p style="white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><span><br></span></p><p style="white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><span>就像斯皮尔伯格所说的：</span></p></section><section style="justify-content: center;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 30px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="display: inline-block;width: 90%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;background-color: rgb(201, 201, 214);padding: 30px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="text-align: justify;color: rgb(32, 32, 32);font-family: PingFangSC-light;letter-spacing: 0.7px;line-height: 1.86;box-sizing: border-box;"><p style="white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span>"Our ears lead our eyes to where the story lives."</span></strong></p><p style="white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><span><br></span></p><p style="white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span>“声音带领我们望向故事发生之处”</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;color: rgb(32, 32, 32);font-family: PingFangSC-light;letter-spacing: 0.7px;line-height: 1.86;box-sizing: border-box;"><p style="white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.7px;box-sizing: border-box;"><span>这是一堂带有实验性质的声音设计鉴赏与即时示范课</span></span></strong><span style="letter-spacing: 0.7px;box-sizing: border-box;"><span>，由实验音乐创作者胡钰馨展开，纪录公社发起人洋主持，首先讲座将沿着时间线，由视听案例贯穿起声音设计史；之后，我们将现场作业，用<a class="" style="" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5NTY3OTU3NA==&#x26;mid=2247497273&#x26;idx=1&#x26;sn=afc655476ad327bf739809a7d5b16206&#x26;scene=21#wechat_redirect" target="_blank">植物絮语训练营</a>的实拍素材</span><span>和触手可及的声音采样即兴进行声音设计实践。</span></span></p><p style="white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><span><br></span></p><p style="white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><span>你不需要区分什么是“音乐”，什么是“声音设计”。参与这次活动，或许只是让你开始意识到：</span><strong style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span>声音一直在被发明与重塑，而你也可以参与其中。</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: center;justify-content: center;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px 0px 60px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="display: inline-block;width: 96%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;margin: 0px;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 96%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 600px" src="http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/vRj1wt8WnHxnlz7ibZLAc55QrknDLwcE21I08ZW64LYjVqaiaf4BIXswcQworicna54ITDF0NN2DepmAxnwSGaEgHtGcibmjDnkIA6ia6vMSEx4I/640?wx_fmt=png&#x26;from=appmsg"></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: center;justify-content: center;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px 0px 90px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="display: inline-block;width: 96%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="margin: 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 600px" src="http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/vRj1wt8WnHyROmicB7gV9NTmSEx9BekDqGke2XQibccBHEcQS6c7Jju8waAj6WIoadUp7zKRUcmV1pgBgBDRpMONmZ50B4UzgVyuibkzFQFiaL8/640?wx_fmt=png&#x26;from=appmsg"></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 60px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 96%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 600px" src="http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/vRj1wt8WnHylMNfFJC5YphQN7SbCTZpX8siaOXutUjDnVZMtjh7rQbXukaicUwPlASFpWrwG8FiaS6QfTJULAzETBTcPZtxafObJoQibXOVySMY/640?wx_fmt=png&#x26;from=appmsg"></section></section><section style="text-align: center;justify-content: center;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px 0px 90px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="display: inline-block;width: 90%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="margin: 0px 0px 20px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 60%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 600px" src="http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/vRj1wt8WnHxCSbOBcO53MWhVfYgHib316cDhWBBcSl57icxj4xP8HZ6I1nsfNISrnDxJSNHTOWSrrtzxMnsg8UpQuBBRww1lIfzkZibphCBjUE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&#x26;from=appmsg"></section></section><section style="justify-content: center;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="display: inline-block;width: 90%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;margin: 0px;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="margin: -4px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="font-size: 18px;font-family: PingFangSC-light;padding: 0px;color: rgb(96, 96, 97);box-sizing: border-box;"><p style="margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span>胡钰馨</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style="justify-content: center;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="display: inline-block;width: 90%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;margin: 0px;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="text-align: justify;color: rgb(32, 32, 32);font-family: PingFangSC-light;line-height: 1.86;letter-spacing: 0.7px;box-sizing: border-box;"><p style="white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.7px;box-sizing: border-box;"><span>胡钰馨(Yuxin Hu栩) 自称“a noisier“，ArtEZ University声音创新硕士。2020-2024年曾担任后摇乐队隐喻河的吉他手，并做过数十部戏剧的声音设计及作曲，也在中国、荷兰办过多次实验音乐相关的工作坊。由于多次跨学科的个人经历，以及酷爱阅读充满拓扑结构、时间错位的小说，她的艺术作品常常给人一种不可思议的感觉。她的作品常以声音艺术的概念为驱动，融合了实验音乐，装置，数媒，自由即兴等手段。研究主要聚焦在探索人类与日常物件的互动，运用acoustic-electronic的手段游走在现实与虚拟世界的边界之间。目前参与Heretical Objects的实验即兴二人组，活跃于荷兰各个地下声景与展览之间。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 60px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;"><img style="vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 600px" src="http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/vRj1wt8WnHx3SZtzctS3ffScyHt0mEvib9jmRqlRH4lNmfymUJkuiaA1bicIyus0j6ulyMefFgJvjPomlibT8xyylsy2cSL5Kw9WwLL2kYYKu3M/640?wx_fmt=png&#x26;from=appmsg"></section></section><section style="text-align: center;justify-content: center;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px 0px 90px;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="display: inline-block;width: 90%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;"><section style="margi